{"availability":"available","full":"ArielFishmongers/wc26-fantasy-dashboard","name":"wc26-fantasy-dashboard","description":"A decision cockpit for the FIFA World Cup 2026 Fantasy game — ownership, form, position-aware fixture difficulty and a rules-accurate transfer planner. Next.js + Drizzle, with a generated demo tournament so it runs with nothing set up.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-17T08:36:05Z","updated":"2026-08-17T11:07:12Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://wc26-fantasy-dashboard-demo.vercel.app","topics":["dashboard","drizzle-orm","fantasy-football","nextjs","tailwindcss","typescript","vercel","world-cup-2026"],"demo":"https://wc26-fantasy-dashboard-demo.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:46:11.032Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T23:46:11.032Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T23:46:11.032Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:02:12.874Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T23:46:11.032Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A decision cockpit for the official FIFA World Cup 2026 Fantasy game. It answers the three questions you actually have on a matchday — who do I bring in, who do I captain, when do I move? — from live prices, ownership, form, and position-aware fixture difficulty.","Built as a single-user tool during the 2026 tournament. The feeds it read are seasonal and now return empty, so it ships with a demo mode built on the real tournament — no credentials or database required.","That's the whole setup. With no configuration the dashboard boots in demo mode on the real 2026 World Cup, frozen 87 minutes into England v Mexico in the Round of 16 — five scored rounds behind you, a live match with four of your players in it, a knockout transfer window open, and a real squad to plan with. Nothing to sign into, no database, no API keys. Take the tour, or read on for how live data works."],"featur